Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?[M27]=20fixture:=20test-edited=20=E2=80=94=20th?=
 =?UTF-8?q?e=20Duomo's=20coordinates=20corrected,=20and=20the=20assertions?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20that=20pin=20them?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
